                                    for i, t in enumerate(stamps, 1)))
    print("\nCHECK THE FOOTAGE BEFORE SUBMITTING -- a tape that recorded an error renders just as\n"
          "happily as one that worked. Open demo.mp4, or read demo-contact.jpg (that is what it\n"
          "is for: a vision model can look at the tiles and say which one shows a failure).")
